<p>This episode features a deep conversation with Rich Clark, a long-term FPL veteran known for his consistent performance. We review specific player statistics and examine how top managers approach difficult squad decisions throughout the season. This session is designed for serious players looking to refine their tactical approach and gain a clearer understanding of current FPL trends.</p>
