<p>By reviewing these team lineups, you will learn how to balance differential picks with essential assets. We break down the logic behind the selections to help you apply these principles to your own squad. Whether you are chasing your mini-league leader or trying to climb the global rankings, this FPL team analysis provides the clarity needed for your next set of transfers.</p>
