Fantasy Premier League live stream and podcast by FPL guru Rich Clarke and fantasy football all-rounder Fergi.
Watch, listen and join in the live chat with their brilliant features every week including Rich Pickings and Fergi is a Punt as the lads give you all the information you need to have a successful FPL season in their own unique way.

